    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 7,
        "sourceEnd": 68,
        "text": "Read the sentence you plan to put in your discussion section.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "a69b3410ab63552acbfa7a2dc818e5ea85e3d7121cdd376b7787d44d990df5c5",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "noah",
        "speaker": "Noah",
        "sourceStart": 75,
        "sourceEnd": 166,
        "text": "The study proves that giving every employee a flexible schedule will increase productivity.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "f5fc2e4d45bc0d787cdb2a3a3a69922d57fa3bfb26becb4d6214a1e79aea35e5",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 174,
        "sourceEnd": 215,
        "text": "Does the source actually make that claim?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "a007f46c24bde9d86e53b6f7ab4996e408cc2f6a728baeb57949386c910c5302",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "noah",
        "speaker": "Noah",
        "sourceStart": 222,
        "sourceEnd": 380,
        "text": "Looking again, it reports an association in three offices. The staff volunteered, and productivity was measured by completed service tickets over eight weeks.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "cc5096be904b6ae0c8c7ac6fd5c51f40021d6b3a649296ad8d8d337f5f39765a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 388,
        "sourceEnd": 449,
        "text": "Then several limits disappeared in your sentence. Which ones?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "a50db2127c5a25792ff5f127bec5e734df7a564b5ba2e06f9b53ee8ae7cd44be",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "noah",
        "speaker": "Noah",
        "sourceStart": 456,
        "sourceEnd": 612,
        "text": "The limited sites, the volunteer sample, the particular outcome measure and the short observation period. I also changed an association into proof of cause.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "5d2db389c92eb4a95c1768e530e317fb657324d589af046b733109d560ada756",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 620,
        "sourceEnd": 645,
        "text": "Try a defensible version.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "be422175ceb1b43f345a43e9cff53e2e1a84c8685d7b5d53fa921d608a693031",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "noah",
        "speaker": "Noah",
        "sourceStart": 652,
        "sourceEnd": 821,
        "text": "In the participating offices, flexible scheduling was associated with more completed tickets during the study period. That wording keeps the setting and measure visible.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "cf6ae79cce761087b474670788e409b1ce93ce7d4656dda8c218d4e48ef71382",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 829,
        "sourceEnd": 873,
        "text": "Can you still offer your own interpretation?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "4f4335c010a24bd25cda4cc33129d16a5d1443d7db955fb907a99b31688f6a28",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "noah",
        "speaker": "Noah",
        "sourceStart": 880,
        "sourceEnd": 1045,
        "text": "Yes, if I label it. I might suggest a longer comparison that also examines ticket quality. Completing more tickets does not necessarily mean solving problems better.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "b7d2a3894867f9f5dc87dc9a8d287591ba47e980c712b4ceee7e6a32e9ae4e84",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 1053,
        "sourceEnd": 1114,
        "text": "How will you separate source and interpretation on the slide?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "f615769eab585100249bb797fb0f184f195eab68d902a5add028c7719d68f2db",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "noah",
        "speaker": "Noah",
        "sourceStart": 1121,
        "sourceEnd": 1337,
        "text": "The first box will state what was observed and give the citation. The second will contain our interpretation and proposed next check. I will not put the stronger claim in the title after weakening it in the footnote.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "2817200b2cf864f6bc2dad02b5a923ed92c396cbabd6460b1c726887ec9dd2a1",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
